==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*7 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[General GreGory]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Perry Duche]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns.
**5 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>.
**1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

